</div></div><div data-civid="6ae7a7971846709166185770" class="contentRender contentRender_10 contentRender_type_widget contentRender_name_plugins_core_textbox" data-sv-time="13" data-sv-index="10" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "1" } }'><section data-sv-core-textbox  data-guid="cd2dee17-a6df-4cc7-823f-09068315eec2">
	<h1 style="text-align: center;">Holiday Lights on the San Antonio River Walk</h1>

<h2 style="text-align: center;"><br />
Day After Thanksgiving - Early January</h2>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Experience the magic of the San Antonio River Walk holiday lights as 200,000 twinkling lights illuminate the towering bald cypress trees along the downtown River Walk! This beloved holiday tradition begins the day after Thanksgiving and continues nightly through early January.<br />
Best of all, enjoying the River Walk Christmas lights is free! Stroll along the river, take in the festive atmosphere, and make unforgettable holiday memories with family and friends. The 2026&ndash;2027 season begins Friday, November 27, 2026, alongside the annual Ford Holiday River Parade and Lighting Ceremony.</p>

</section></div><div data-civid="6ae7a7971846709166185772" class="contentRender contentRender_11 contentRender_type_panel contentRender_name_plugins_common_two_col" data-sv-time="1" data-sv-index="11" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "1" } }'><div class="panel-two-column even sv-panel">
	<div class="left-container sv-col">
		<div data-civid="6ae7a7971846709166185774" class="contentRender contentRender_12 contentRender_type_widget contentRender_name_plugins_common_embed" data-sv-time="13" data-sv-index="12" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "1" } }'>

<div class="custom-embed controlled center " data-sv-embed-widget="true"  data-guid="0c7cde4b-a903-4406-af05-e832887cf87e">
	<div class="embed-container">
		<blockquote class="tiktok-embed" cite="https://www.tiktok.com/@visitsanantonio/video/7307004556683005215" data-video-id="7307004556683005215" style="max-width: 605px;min-width: 325px;" > <section> <a target="_blank" title="@visitsanantonio" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@visitsanantonio?refer=embed">@visitsanantonio</a> ✨Holiday Lights are officially on through Jan. 7 2023 ✨ Experience over 100,000 lights (2,250 strings of light) draped over the towering bald cypress trees that line the River Walk. ❄️🎄✨ <a title="sariverwalk" target="_blank" href="https://www.tiktok.com/tag/sariverwalk?refer=embed">#SARiverWalk</a> <a title="visitsanantonio" target="_blank" href="https://www.tiktok.com/tag/visitsanantonio?refer=embed">#VisitSanAntonio</a> <a title="sanantoniotiktok" target="_blank" href="https://www.tiktok.com/tag/sanantoniotiktok?refer=embed">#sanantoniotiktok</a> <a title="holidaycountdown" target="_blank" href="https://www.tiktok.com/tag/holidaycountdown?refer=embed">#holidaycountdown</a> <a title="riverwalksanantonio" target="_blank" href="https://www.tiktok.com/tag/riverwalksanantonio?refer=embed">#riverwalksanantonio</a> <a title="christmas" target="_blank" href="https://www.tiktok.com/tag/christmas?refer=embed">#christmas</a> <a title="holidaytiktok" target="_blank" href="https://www.tiktok.com/tag/holidaytiktok?refer=embed">#holidaytiktok</a> <a title="christmaslights" target="_blank" href="https://www.tiktok.com/tag/christmaslights?refer=embed">#christmaslights</a> <a title="riverwalkchicago" target="_blank" href="https://www.tiktok.com/tag/riverwalkchicago?refer=embed">#riverwalkchicago</a> <a title="sanantonioriverwalk" target="_blank" href="https://www.tiktok.com/tag/sanantonioriverwalk?refer=embed">#sanantonioriverwalk</a> <a target="_blank" title="♬ We Wish You A Merry Christmas (TikTok Version 1) - Elsa Japasal" href="https://www.tiktok.com/music/We-Wish-You-A-Merry-Christmas-TikTok-Version-1-7038852209332881410?refer=embed">♬ We Wish You A Merry Christmas (TikTok Version 1) - Elsa Japasal</a> </section> </blockquote> <script async src="https://www.tiktok.com/embed.js"></script>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
	</div>
	<div class="right-container sv-col">
		<div data-civid="6ae7a7971846709166185776" class="contentRender contentRender_13 contentRender_type_widget contentRender_name_plugins_core_textbox" data-sv-time="41" data-sv-index="13" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "2" } }'><section data-sv-core-textbox  data-guid="0003ee2f-1d1c-4402-b488-83ed16420433">
	<p><span style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">The famous holiday lights on the River Walk light up each year, the day after Thanksgiving, at our&#xA0;<a href="https://www.thesanantonioriverwalk.com/events/ford-holiday-river-parade/" target="_blank">Annual Ford Holiday River Parade</a>&#xA0;and shine each night brightly through early January.</span></p>

<p>Our <a data-sv-linklookup-id="65fda1624896441934b36221" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_riverwalk_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.thesanantonioriverwalk.com/events/ford-holiday-river-parade/" target="_self">Annual Ford Holiday River Parade</a>&#xA0;kicks off the holiday season and is the official televised lighting ceremony at <a data-sv-linklookup-id="4672" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_listings_listing" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.thesanantonioriverwalk.com/listing/arneson-river-theatre-at-la-villita/4672/" target="_self">Arneson River Theatre</a>.&#xA0;Join us for this festive event on Friday, November 27, 2026.</p>

<p>We invite you to experience the spectacular display of 200,000 lights&#xA0;draped across the towering bald cypress trees lining the River Walk.</p>

<p>Visiting the River Walk to enjoy the spectacular holiday lights is<b>&#xA0;free.</b>&#xA0;The River Walk is a public park open 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. Holiday lights are on the downtown portion of the River Walk.&#xA0;</p>

<p>Check our <a data-sv-linklookup-id="65bd53e2050bdc402f2b3886" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_riverwalk_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.thesanantonioriverwalk.com/events/" target="_self">Events</a> page&#xA0;for other events that coincide with the holiday lights, like&#xA0;the <a data-sv-linklookup-id="667c87d40c1694606af5eb8a" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_riverwalk_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.thesanantonioriverwalk.com/events/ford-holiday-boat-caroling/" target="_self">Ford Holiday Boat Caroling</a>.</p>

</section></div>
	</div>
</div></div><div data-civid="6ae7a82218467091661857b5" class="contentRender contentRender_14 contentRender_type_widget contentRender_name_plugins_core_textbox" data-sv-time="13" data-sv-index="14" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "3" } }'><section data-sv-core-textbox  data-guid="9ffc21a0-3fa8-4e67-a9ab-6043316d8e07">
	<h3>When Are the San Antonio River Walk Holiday Lights On?</h3>

<p><br />
The San Antonio River Walk holiday lights return each year on the day after Thanksgiving and shine nightly through early January.<br />
For the 2026&ndash;2027 holiday season, the lights begin on Friday, November 27, 2026, during the Ford Holiday River Parade and Lighting Ceremony.<br />
Visitors can enjoy the festive display throughout the holiday season, making it a wonderful addition to a winter getaway or an evening exploring downtown San Antonio.</p>

</section></div><div data-civid="6ae7a84818467091661857c2" class="contentRender contentRender_15 contentRender_type_widget contentRender_name_plugins_core_textbox" data-sv-time="13" data-sv-index="15" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "4" } }'><section data-sv-core-textbox  data-guid="c9efc1db-02d0-48c3-a219-da6dd4a20103">
	<h3>Enjoy the River Walk Holiday Lights for Free</h3>

<p><br />
Looking for a free holiday activity in San Antonio? The River Walk holiday lights are free to enjoy, with no ticket required to stroll along the downtown river and take in the festive display.<br />
The San Antonio River Walk is a public park open 24 hours a day, seven days a week. During the holiday season, visitors can explore the riverbanks beneath thousands of sparkling lights and enjoy the sights of downtown San Antonio.<br />
It&#39;s a memorable way to celebrate the season without purchasing admission to a special event.</p>

</section></div><div data-civid="6ae7a86918467091661857c9" class="contentRender contentRender_16 contentRender_type_widget contentRender_name_plugins_core_textbox" data-sv-time="13" data-sv-index="16" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "5" } }'><section data-sv-core-textbox  data-guid="65503ee7-df4e-45db-ac23-b1e794285e45">
	<h3>Where to See the Holiday Lights on the River Walk</h3>

<p><br />
The holiday lights illuminate the downtown portion of the San Antonio River Walk, where towering bald cypress trees are decorated with thousands of sparkling lights.<br />
Take a leisurely stroll along the river, enjoy the festive atmosphere, or plan an evening at a nearby River Walk restaurant while exploring the holiday display.<br />
Before heading downtown, check the River Walk maps and parking information to help plan your visit.</p>

</section></div><div data-civid="6ae7a88618467091661857d0" class="contentRender contentRender_17 contentRender_type_widget contentRender_name_plugins_core_textbox" data-sv-time="13" data-sv-index="17" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "6" } }'><section data-sv-core-textbox  data-guid="bdef929f-6995-4748-8f3f-6046e21b0d51">
	<h3>More Holiday Events on the San Antonio River Walk</h3>

<p><br />
The holiday lights are just one of the ways to celebrate the season along the San Antonio River Walk!<br />
Kick off the festivities with the Ford Holiday River Parade and Lighting Ceremony, or enjoy the sounds of the season during Ford Holiday Boat Caroling on select December evenings.<br />
Explore the River Walk Events calendar to discover even more celebrations happening throughout the holiday season.</p>

</section></div><div data-civid="6ae7a7971846709166185778" class="contentRender contentRender_18 contentRender_type_widget contentRender_name_plugins_common_photo_album" data-sv-time="48" data-sv-index="18" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "1" } }'>



