</script></div><div data-civid="6ae7a93f184670916618582e" class="contentRender contentRender_21 contentRender_type_widget contentRender_name_plugins_core_textbox" data-sv-time="14" data-sv-index="21" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "8" } }'><section data-sv-core-textbox  data-guid="16613206-0fa7-4613-862e-8dbca41571b7">
	<h3>Plan Your Holiday Visit to the River Walk</h3>

<p><br />
From sparkling bald cypress trees to festive riverfront celebrations, the San Antonio River Walk is a magical place to experience the holiday season.<br />
Gather your family and friends, explore the downtown holiday lights, and discover the restaurants, attractions, and seasonal events that make San Antonio special this time of year.</p>

</section></div><div data-civid="65bd4e2b050bdc402f2b355d" class="contentRender contentRender_22 contentRender_type_panel contentRender_name_plugins_common_container" data-sv-time="0" data-sv-index="22" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "1" } }'><div class="panel-container">
